  "body": "As a defense-in-depth measure, it would be great to add the labels mentioned in https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=21057#c16 to the replacement encoding. It's however unclear whether that is web-compatible, as sites might specify these labels and rely on them not being recognized.\n\nFiling this issue so hopefully one day a browser can experiment and figure out if this is doable.\n",
